<p>Hexes your target, dazing it and everything in a 2 radius ball around it for 3 turns and giving a <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">31%, 37%, 41%, 45%, 47%</acronym> chance to daze affected targets again each turn for 20 turns.</p><p>The chance will increase with your Spellpower.</p>